(7291204, 1136458, 100831, '<td valign="top">Playful! Nice capture.</td>', 'Playful! Nice capture.', '2014-12-08 08:39:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7291208, 1136160, 135629, '<td valign="top">Both of my dogs are inseparable, and the best of friends but when they have toys or treats... They only ever want the exact thing the other has. Often times one bone or toy will sit alone on the floor while they spend the life of the other item trying to out-strategize the other for ownership. It''s consistent entertainment if anything else.</td>', 'Both of my dogs are inseparable, and the best of friends but when they have toys or treats... They only ever want the exact thing the other has. Often times one bone or toy will sit alone on the floor while they spend the life of the other item trying to out-strategize the other for ownership. It''s consistent entertainment if anything else.', '2014-12-08 09:08:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7291213, 1136225, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough, but not really "the moment" that would have gotten you the handful of 7''s necessary to take this above a 6.<br/> <br/>the knee is blocking the dog, the arms are blocking the face, the ball is in her hands, the dog is just standing.  there''s no sense of motion or dynamics.  all the technicals are there, it''s just missing the emotional connectivity.</td>', 'nice enough, but not really "the moment" that would have gotten you the handful of 7''s necessary to take this above a 6. the knee is blocking the dog, the arms are blocking the face, the ball is in her hands, the dog is just standing.  there''s no sense of motion or dynamics.  all the technicals are there, it''s just missing the emotional connectivity.', '2014-12-08 09:31:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7291232, 1136379, 61396, '<td valign="top">it does seem happy, doesn''t it?</td>', 'it does seem happy, doesn''t it?', '2014-12-08 10:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7291269, 1136144, 61396, '<td valign="top">well illustrated.</td>', 'well illustrated.', '2014-12-08 11:10:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7291304, 1136225, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think Skip hits all the major points, but I''d also add that the leaf background texture and color are also very distracting, and detract from the main subject.  I might have softened both the texture and the color to help focus the eye more on the pals, but the moment you caught is more special to you than for the viewer.</td>', 'I think Skip hits all the major points, but I''d also add that the leaf background texture and color are also very distracting, and detract from the main subject.  I might have softened both the texture and the color to help focus the eye more on the pals, but the moment you caught is more special to you than for the viewer.', '2014-12-08 13:21:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7291317, 1136458, 60173, '<td valign="top">I did a quick glance through your outtakes, and I agree that this is by far the best shot. It''s an excellent example of breaking the centered subject rule and getting away with it. The composition is solid and interesting. Both man and pup seem to be having a great time. It''s a great photo for this challenge, because their youthful, healthy energy shines through. I love shots that are taken from behind or silhouetted, because it allows the viewer to transport themselves into the scene. Sometimes when a human''s face is included in a photo, it draws attention to itself and distracts from the real purpose. Great job.</td>', 'I did a quick glance through your outtakes, and I agree that this is by far the best shot. It''s an excellent example of breaking the centered subject rule and getting away with it. The composition is solid and interesting. Both man and pup seem to be having a great time. It''s a great photo for this challenge, because their youthful, healthy energy shines through. I love shots that are taken from behind or silhouetted, because it allows the viewer to transport themselves into the scene. Sometimes when a human''s face is included in a photo, it draws attention to itself and distracts from the real purpose. Great job.', '2014-12-08 13:51:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7291379, 1136471, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> what?  I would never let Darcy use any of my cameras. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I don''t let her near the DSLRs, but this is just a phone.</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: what?  I would never let Darcy use any of my cameras.   I don''t let her near the DSLRs, but this is just a phone.', '2014-12-08 16:06:09.000000', NULL, 0),
