(7291831, 1136403, 178630, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much for your votes.<br/>I''m very happy about the 4th place :-))).<br/>It was my second photo in the dpchallenge ...<br/>It wasn''t easy to get them both in this position,<br/>sometimes my nephew looked very bad or Hedi (the baby-dog)<br/>jumped away. The sun went down, it got darker and darker,<br/>the ISO setting higher and higher, my fingers were frozen. <br/>But then it worked.</td>', 'Thank you very much for your votes.I''m very happy about the 4th place :-))).It was my second photo in the dpchallenge ...It wasn''t easy to get them both in this position,sometimes my nephew looked very bad or Hedi (the baby-dog)jumped away. The sun went down, it got darker and darker,the ISO setting higher and higher, my fingers were frozen. But then it worked.', '2014-12-10 03:51:12.000000', NULL, 0),
